(full SRD -- focus on requirements R2.1, R2.2, R2.3)\n      - cmd/chown/main.go (existing implementation covering R1.1 through R1.4)\n      - cmd/chgrp/main.go (sibling utility with recursive traversal and symlink handling for reference)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/chown/main.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Add recursive ownership change (-R) with symlink traversal options (-H, -L, -P)\n      - path: cmd/chown/chown_test.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Add differential test cases for recursive and symlink behavior\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement srd091 R2.1 as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Implement srd091 R2.2 as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Implement srd091 R2.3 as specified in the SRD\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"All cmd/ utilities call sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() at the start of main per shared protocol\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Reference binary for differential testing is gchown (Homebrew coreutils g-prefix convention)\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Differential tests use pkg/testutils.RunDiffTests to compare against gchown with LC_ALL=C\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"go build ./cmd/chown/ compiles without errors\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"go vet ./cmd/chown/ passes with no warnings\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"go test ./cmd/chown/ -count=1 passes -- differential tests for R2.1, R2.2, R2.3 match gchown output\"\n\n- index: 1\n  title: \"[stitch] Implement cmd/chown error handling and verbose output (srd091 R3.1, R3.2, R3.3)\"\n  dependency: 0\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd091-chown.yaml (full SRD -- focus on requirements R3.1, R3.2, R3.3)\n      - cmd/chown/main.go (existing implementation covering R1.1 through R2.3)\n      - cmd/chgrp/main.go (sibling utility with error handling and verbose output for reference)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/chown/main.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Add error handling, verbose output (-v), and changes-only output (-c)\n      - path: cmd/chown/chown_test.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Add differential test cases for error handling and verbose output\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement srd091 R3.1 as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Implement srd091 R3.2 as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Implement srd091 R3.3 as specified in the SRD\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Reference binary for differential testing is gchown (Homebrew coreutils g-prefix convention)\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Differential tests use pkg/testutils.RunDiffTests to compare against gchown with LC_ALL=C\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Error messages must match GNU chown format for differential test parity\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"go build ./cmd/chown/ compiles without errors\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"go vet ./cmd/chown/ passes with no warnings\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"go test ./cmd/chown/ -count=1 passes -- differential tests for R3.1, R3.2, R3.3 match gchown output\"\n\n- index: 2\n  title: \"[stitch] Implement cmd/mkfifo core FIFO creation and mode setting (srd092 R1.1, R1.2, R1.3, R1.4)\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd092-mkfifo.yaml (full SRD -- focus on requirements R1.1, R1.2, R1.3, R1.4)\n      - pkg/sys/sys.go (SIGPIPE handler and syscall abstractions)\n      - cmd/mkfifo/ (verify directory is empty or does not exist before creating files)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/mkfifo/main.go\n        action: create\n        note: mkfifo utility -- creates named pipes (FIFOs) with optional mode setting\n      - path: cmd/mkfifo/mkfifo_test